# Added to sitl.params for the VTOL (AIRFRAME=vtol, PX4 4004; Phase 7, spec A91). Placeholders.
# Fixed-wing airspeeds for the scaled standard VTOL: stall about 6.8 m/s at 14.6 kg, cruise at
# the scenario's 15 m/s, a minimum with margin over stall.
FW_AIRSPD_STALL 7.0
FW_AIRSPD_MIN 10.0
FW_AIRSPD_TRIM 15.0
FW_AIRSPD_MAX 22.0
# Transition: leave multirotor mode at this airspeed, and give the transitions time.
VT_ARSP_TRANS 12.0
VT_TRANS_TIMEOUT 30.0
VT_B_TRANS_DUR 8.0
# The disarm timer applies after any landing; offboard stays as in sitl.params.
